      R. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَهْصَهَ بِهِمْ</span></b>  <i>He silenced them, saying
to them</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَهْ صَهْ</span>: (K, TA:) and they said also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَهْصَيْتُ</span> [for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَهْصَهْتُ</span>], like as they said <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَهْدَيْتُ</span>
for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَهْدَهْتُ</span>. (TA.)

